msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "650328"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650360"
msgid "This is the entrance.\nIf I had to say what this #RUBS gate#RUBEdoor#REND is used for……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650452"
msgid "#C236196003Issei#CDEF said this was the \"supply room,\"\nso I figure this is a \"space\" for storing\nthings no one is using."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650576"
msgid "Whatever the case, there's no reason for me to go inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650636"
msgid "I take the key out from my pocket.\nBetter hurry up and lock it so I can get to class."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650724"
msgid "…oh?\nDid that sound come from inside just now…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650776"
msgid "Since I was tasked with locking this door,\nI can't just ignore it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650844"
msgid "I put my ear to the door to listen in on\nwhat's happening inside……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650916"
msgid "All the others are way too amazing, like damn.\nWay too serious. Way too desperate.\nI'll leave that holy war to the PKs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651036"
msgid "I mean, should be fine to hide out here\nuntil the winner gets called. Camping my way\nto victory―#C236196003jinaKO#CDEF, you genius, you! lol"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651180"
msgid "……there's obviously someone in there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651220"
msgid "――――――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651236"
msgid "……the suspicious sounds continued for about\na minute before settling down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651316"
msgid "I take a deep breath and knock on the door again.\nI announce my entrance, then open the door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651412"
msgid "……I don't feel like going into this room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651456"
msgid "I just got to the stairs leading to the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651512"
msgid "――――Then,\nI suddenly heard a voice overhead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651564"
msgid "Oh dear. Oooh dear. Oooooh dear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651600"
msgid "It \"sounds like\" nothing!\nSomeone's really falling down right now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651672"
msgid "With a sudden crash, I fall on my back into the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651732"
msgid "I hit the back of my head onto the hard floor.\nMy brain shakes and my eyes spin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651816"
msgid "……what on Earth just happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651852"
msgid "My…… A feisty little hand, isn't it?\nHmhm…… Do you have any idea where you're\ntouching a woman right now……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651968"
msgid "Sure enough, my fingers weren't grasping at the sky.\nThey've almost dissolved into a great mass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652068"
msgid "There's such a ridiculous plenty of volume,\nreminiscent of the bountiful plots of the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652164"
msgid "Mm…… ahh, please forgive me……\nWe're causing a scene in such a public place…\nI can't do this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652264"
msgid "Ahhh―― Not just your fingers,\nbut with your lips too――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652324"
msgid "A term is born within my mind which I coin\n\"magnifi-meat.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652384"
msgid "\nBut―― come to think of it,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652416"
msgid "My…… This is the first time\nI've had it so rough…… Do you have some\ndeep resentment towards my breasts……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652528"
msgid "I'm sorry, this was my fault.\nI had no idea that my chest\nwas stopping you from breathing……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652624"
msgid "I'm so sorry,\nI'll get off of you right awa―― ah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652676"
msgid "Hello? Hello?\nAre you okay there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652712"
msgid "Ohh, what should I do, there's no response.\nHomeroom will begin shortly,\nbut I just keep causing problems……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652824"
msgid "All I remember is that something incredible fell on me,\nand that I came to my senses after I hit the back of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652944"
msgid "When I pulled myself together and looked up,\nthere was the face of an unfamiliar woman before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653044"
msgid "……ohh, I'm so relieved.\nIf you're still alive,\nthen I can properly apologize to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653132"
msgid "But I don't really have much time right now.\nThank you, oh cute little student.\nMay I have your name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653236"
msgid "Sh-she's way too close……!\nIf she leans down on me that sensually,\nthere's no way I could think normally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653344"
msgid "Ahaha…… just like #[that of an radiant fish][a lovely little flower]#.\nYou have a wonderful name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653444"
msgid "I'll be sure to thank you later.\nI need to prepare for class,\nso please excuse me for going on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653548"
msgid "Well, see you later then.\nI'll be looking forward to working with you,\nokay, lovely little #C000246204Master#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653664"
msgid "……yeah, I've been though some outrageous things this morning.\nIf a classmate saw what happened just now……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653776"
msgid "――――Just now……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653800"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653816"
msgid "Someone actually saw me――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653848"
msgid "The one in the red school uniform who's\nglaring at me like I'm human garbage\nis my classmate who recently transferred in: #C236196003Leo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653992"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF seems to have seen the entire thing\nfrom the top of the stairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654076"
msgid "Good morning, #[Mister][Miss]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\n#[You sure are frisky][You sure are unrestrained]# this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654196"
msgid "All of a sudden, my feet stopped."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654232"
msgid "It's not like I tripped on anything,\nor that someone called out and stopped me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654312"
msgid "Pain rushes through my left hand.\nWhen I held it up to see why, right there was――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654396"
msgid "#C080080080My mind――my mind, my consciousness is coming apart……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654468"
msgid "#C080080080What is this?\nI'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared.\nThere's no headache. There's no pain.\nIn fact, it's more like a peaceful rest.\nIf I fall asleep just like this, how wonderful would it be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654680"
msgid "#C080080080But I'm scared.\nThere's no pain, but a fissure runs through me.\nIt's not my disconnected mind, but my beating heart\nthat seems to be calling out this abnormality――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654860"
msgid "……just a little more……!\nWait for m…… I'm coming fo…… right now……\nDon't you…… dare forget…… me…… Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654980"
msgid "Dammit…… this is…… to get through……!\nDon't get tric…… nto believi…… alse memor…\nIf you can hear…… answer me…… Mast……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655116"
msgid "……is there even an end to this!?\nArgh, I won't let up! Master, I'll be ther……\nDear Cast…… coming for…… fast as I can!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655244"
msgid "――――The vertigo subsided in about two seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655296"
msgid "As I swing my head, I put my hand to my chest\nto check my heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655368"
msgid "A vague anxiety, gouging at my chest.\nSo much, to the point my heart could stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655452"
msgid "That conviction shoots up from my spine to the brain.\nNormally/Strangely, the usual me\nwould've sprinted out of the school building by now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655592"
msgid "\"Don't you…… dare forget…… me…… Master!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655640"
msgid "Right now, that anxiety I felt is more important to me.\nIt's the voice of someone I shouldn't ever forget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655748"
msgid "\"If you can hear…… answer me…… Mast……\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655796"
msgid "Right now, that anxiety I felt is more important to me.\nIt's the voice of someone I shouldn't ever forget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655904"
msgid "\"Dear Cast…… coming for you…… fast as I can!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655956"
msgid "Right now, that anxiety I felt is more important to me.\nIt's the voice of someone I shouldn't ever forget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656064"
msgid "……I have to remember them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656096"
msgid "Even if this is a world \"I shouldn't be in,\"\na hell I should run away from as fast as I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656192"
msgid "……but before that, it feels like I need to at least\nrecover the name of that voice's owner on my own……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656300"
msgid "All of a sudden, my feet stopped."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656336"
msgid "It's not like I tripped on anything,\nor that someone called out and stopped me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656416"
msgid "Pain rushes through my left hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656452"
msgid "――――The vertigo subsided in about two seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656504"
msgid "As I swing my head, I put my hand to my chest\nto check my heartbeat.\n……what was with that throbbing?\nIt's like my head and heart were the organs\nof some other being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656672"
msgid "Pounding in my chest. A primal pulse calling out to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656728"
msgid "……I wonder if that was a hallucination.\nI heard the sound of a heart\nas an indescribable anxiety enveloped my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656848"
msgid "A vague anxiety gouging at my chest.\nSo much, to the point my heart could stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656928"
msgid "That hallucination shoots up my spine, voicelessly echoing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656988"
msgid "No, this isn't it. I think the storeroom should be\nat #C000246204the other end of the hallway#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657088"
msgid "I don't have any business here.\nI need to hurry to my #C000246204classroom on the second floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657192"
msgid "Is there any reason I need to go to the garden?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657240"
msgid "……after thinking about it for a bit, my answer is \"no.\"\nI should #C000246204head home for the day#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657348"
msgid "……!\nThe outside has already been covered with pitch-black Noise!\nGoing into the schoolyard won't help me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657456"
msgid "……yet again, I feel pain rushing through my left hand.\nThere's a strange bruise on the back of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657560"
msgid "Am I worried about the bruise because of my headache,\nor do I have a headache because of this bruise?\nI have no idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657680"
msgid "……yeah.\nBefore I go home,                   #C001246204Before the morning comes#CDEF,\nI should have someone take a look at this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657812"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF would be fine. #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF or #C236196003Rani#CDEF would be fine.\nI wouldn't even mind #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657960"
msgid "Anyways, if I show this #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF to someone I know,\nI'm sure that――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658052"
msgid "#C255045045Time limit has been reached.\nAttention all intelligent beings\nstill within the school grounds:#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658164"
msgid "#C255045045We must regretfully inform you:\nthere has been a breakdown in how you all\nhave been perceiving this world.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658288"
msgid "#C255045045This is a collapse in value, due to inflation.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658352"
msgid "#C255045045The Holy Grail War has been sold off\nand all of you along with it.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658436"
msgid "Wh-what was with that announcement just now!?\nNo, more importantly,\nwhat's with this bizarre transformation――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658552"
msgid "Everyone's  being stabbed――\n                  breaking――\n                  melting――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658644"
msgid "Everyone's  everyone's  being #RUBS     killed#RUBEproces--sed#REND――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658716"
msgid "Wh-what the hell is happening――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658752"
msgid "Feeling the danger, I looked outside.\nIt was dark, as if I was staring into a hole."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658836"
msgid "Forget the entrance, window after window\nhas been covered by that black Noise……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658920"
msgid "I'm gonna have to run for it……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658956"
msgid "It wouldn't be good to get touched by that black Noise.\nIf it's engulfed the entrance and the windows,\nthe only way left is up……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659088"
msgid "It's the end of the day.\nThe school building is dyed in the colors of the sunset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659172"
msgid "There are students at the entrance, heading home.\nLaughter and chitchat fill the air.\nThe usual scene, the usual life.\nI'm also just about to visit my shoe locker and leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659348"
msgid "In the shadows of this twilight,\nthere's a single girl collapsed on the floor in pain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659436"
msgid "Her breath is worn, and her cheeks are flushed.\nShe's clearly sick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659504"
msgid "This scene is not normal.\nI'm starting to doubt my sanity…… no,\nthe sanity of the people around me.\nThere's no way every single person could just ignore this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659668"
msgid "There hasn't been so much as a single person\nwho's even glanced at the girl in the white coat."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "659764"
msgid "Call out to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659784"
msgid "In any case, I have to do something as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659844"
msgid "I lift up the suffering girl. And up……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659888"
msgid "……well, this is troubling.\nI know this isn't the time, but I'm getting a little nervous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659980"
msgid "The sweat adorning her white skin is so captivating\nthat any guy would find them―― no,\neven girls would find themselves unable to look away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660124"
msgid "It's a little rude, but she kinda reminds me of sugar candy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660188"
msgid "I'm seeing her, and I'm holding her.\nThat's why I'm able to help her up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660264"
msgid "……she may have a terrible fever.\nIt's so bad that she's not really present\nand can't tell what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660376"
msgid "I call out to her. But it doesn't seem like she's waking up.\nI feel bad, but I grab her by the shoulders and shake her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660496"
msgid "Her eyes peek out, as if they were seeing a fleeting dream.\nHer thin arms and shoulders covered in a white coat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660612"
msgid "What a strange thing to say.\nI can hear the labored breaths in her voice.\nI'm holding her arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660708"
msgid "That's why I'm going to help her up.\nI tell her that it's the obvious thing to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660792"
msgid "……?\nThat's not really something I have an answer for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660848"
msgid "I'm not in any committees,\nso I respond with my name and classroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660916"
msgid "Wha…… you're an, ordinary student……?\nNot even the student council members\nnoticed me, but you did……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661024"
msgid "……poor thing. No one offered any help.\nThat must've hurt physically and emotionally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661112"
msgid "\"You're safe now.\"\nI lend her my shoulder to match my words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661176"
msgid "That's all it took for this girl, calling herself \"#C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\"\nto stare back at me with eyes wide open."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661296"
msgid "……she seems to be having trouble breathing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661344"
msgid "It's like the blankness\nin the instant you watch a miracle unfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661412"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF-senpai……\nUmm…… would it be all right if,\nwe talked a little longer……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661512"
msgid "Answering her with a nod,\nI pick up the freshman girl…… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661596"
msgid "Luckily, the Infirmary is right around the corner.\nI should get her to a bed first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661680"
msgid "I haven't forgotten anything.\nThere's no reason for me to go back outside.\nI should get to class."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661780"
msgid "The outside has already been covered with pitch-black Noise.\nIf I don't run #C000246204up#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661880"
msgid "I should go see #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF before I go home.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF said she's probably in the garden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662000"
msgid "I'm feeling pretty good.\nI don't need to be checked out at the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662076"
msgid "There's no sign of anyone in the Infirmary.\nLooks like the nurse and the health committee are all out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662180"
msgid "While I am worried about how #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is doing,\nI should let her get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662276"
msgid "I #[should probably][think I should]# go home for the day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662336"
msgid "The cafeteria is just up ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662368"
msgid "They've been remodelling it since last week,\nso no one's allowed to go in right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662456"
msgid "The cafeteria is just up ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662488"
msgid "They've been remodelling it since last week,\nso none of us could get any lunch.\nThe students are very dissatisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662604"
msgid "There's no choice but to go #C000246204up#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662656"
msgid "The supply room……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662680"
msgid "No, Issei said it was the #C000246204supply storeroom#CDEF.\nIt's not this one, but the storeroom #C000246204to the far left#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662812"
msgid "……if I see this as a classroom,\nthen I'm probably not thinking straight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662888"
msgid "I can't just stand here, zoned out. Let's get a move on\nand head to the #C000246204classroom on the 2nd floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663004"
msgid "……come to think of it,\nI've never seen anyone come and go from this room before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663088"
msgid "Is it just not in use right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663124"
msgid "…………!\nAs soon as I open the supply room,\na pitch-black tentacle reaches out from inside.\nI can't let myself get caught by those tendrils……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663272"
msgid "This is classroom 1-A."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663296"
msgid "Even though no one is around,\nthe silence is so absolute that it's somewhat unnerving."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663384"
msgid "This is classroom 1-A."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663408"
msgid "There are still a few students around,\nbut they'd give a weird look\nif some upperclassman just walked in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663516"
msgid "I should do them a favor and quietly take my leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663568"
msgid "This classroom's already gone……!\nThere's nowhere to go but #C000246204up#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663652"
msgid "This is classroom 1-B."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663676"
msgid "This classroom feels totally lifeless.\nDoesn't look like anyone is around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663752"
msgid "This is classroom 1-B."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663776"
msgid "There're several students chatting away.\nBut there isn't anyone I recognize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663856"
msgid "This is classroom 1-C."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663880"
msgid "All of the first year classrooms seem totally devoid of life.\nI wonder what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663968"
msgid "This is classroom 1-C."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663992"
msgid "There's no one in this classroom.\nI guess everyone already left for home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664068"
msgid "Inside the faculty office, the teachers\nare all busy preparing for their classes.\nIt's the usual scene before the school day begins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664204"
msgid "I'd get yelled at if I went into the faculty office now,\nso I'm not gonna do that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664288"
msgid "There aren't many students who like visiting\nthe faculty office. And sorry to say,\nbut #[I'm][I happen to be]# in the majority that don't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664428"
msgid "I feel a dull pain the moment I make contact\nwith the tendril coming from the alarm.\nIt's too dangerous here. I have to run……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664560"
msgid "I think I was taught how to use a fire extinguisher……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664616"
msgid "I can't seem to remember how though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664656"
msgid "I tried going for the fire extinguisher,\nbut the pitch-black Noise cut me off before I could!\nI'll have to give up on it and run!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664788"
msgid "The exam schedule has been posted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664824"
msgid "Exams……\nI regret even thinking about this topic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664876"
msgid "I reach for the bulletin board, but a dull pain\nmakes me reflexively draw back.\nI have to run away, or else this Noise will……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665004"
msgid "It's a bulletin board, but nothing's posted here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665056"
msgid "There's no time to look at something like that.\nI have keep running #C000246204up#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665148"
msgid "[Fighting on school grounds is strictly prohibited.]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665204"
msgid "It's a bulletin board, but nothing's posted here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665256"
msgid "The schedule for the freshmen's school year\nis written up here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665320"
msgid "It's pretty much the same as the other grades,\nthe biggest difference being the entrance ceremony in April."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665428"
msgid "Below Student Council President #C236196003Issei#CDEF,\nthe names of the other members are posted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665528"
msgid "[From the Faculty:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665548"
msgid "Next week is exam week.\n   Make sure to wrap up club activities early\n   and try to be in your best shape for your exams.]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665672"
msgid "There's no time to look at something like that.\nI have keep running #C000246204up#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665764"
msgid "[Notice from the Health Committee]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665800"
msgid "Things like nutritional balance, washing your hands,\nand rinsing your mouth are written up on here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665900"
msgid "The boys' bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665920"
msgid "I don't need to go right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665952"
msgid "The boys' bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665972"
msgid "……yep, I don't have the guts to walk in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666016"
msgid "It's already been covered by the Noise.\nI'll have to find another place to run……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666100"
msgid "The girls' bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666124"
msgid "The girls' bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666148"
msgid "I don't need to go right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666180"
msgid "Did you happen to notice the students\nwearing different-color uniforms?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666252"
msgid "Black uniforms are worn by the\npublic morals committee and club presidents."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666328"
msgid "I want to improve my autonomic precision,\npromote from being an ordinary student―so I\ncan stand by President #C236196003Ryuudou#CDEF's side too……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666480"
msgid "Ohhh my gosh……\nDid I really just say that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666528"
msgid "Not too long ago, he……\nOh, s-sorry, it's nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666580"
msgid "O-oh no! I didn't say anything!\nPlease don't mention it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666640"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…… She's great, isn't she?\nJust once, I wanna stroke\nthat nice black hair of hers……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666752"
msgid "'kay, when we get back,\nwe're going to cram school.\nEntrance exam prep sure is harsh～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666840"
msgid "My friend went home without waiting for me,\nand she's not answering my messages……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666924"
msgid "We agreed to meet up here,\nthen go to cram school together.\nNow what do I do……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667008"
msgid "I have to get…… to cram school……\nI have to go, but……\nmy body won't move……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667092"
msgid "What is \"cram school,\" anyway?\nI don't care…… there's no point in going……\nAs soon as…… I fall asleep…… everyth……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667216"
msgid "Hey hey, didja hear? About the one\nin charge of that second year class."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667288"
msgid "Whaaat? You're kidding! It's already a no-no for\na student and teacher to have a relationship,\nbut to risk it ON campus!? Now that's brave!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667428"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. He's a grade above us, but\nhe's so cute that he doesn't look it at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667512"
msgid "He's so tiny and cute, isn't he～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667548"
msgid "But something about the youthfulness\nhe exudes seems out of place……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667620"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nIf you loaf around this much,\nyou'll end up being late."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667716"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nIf you loaf around this much,\nyou'll end up being late."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667812"
msgid "Isn't it such a pain that we have to\nclimb up to the second floor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667880"
msgid "Did you know that the art club\npicks out daily themes for their sketches?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667956"
msgid "Today's theme is \"cherry#RUBS     sakura#RUBE#REND blossoms.\"\nBut cherry blossoms aren't even in season!\nOh, what should I do……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668088"
msgid "Nothing to do 'bout it, then.\nGuess I'll skip club today as well\nand go home. It's lovely weather out."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "668192"
msgid "You can check your #C000246204next goal#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668240"
msgid "……I've somehow been run out of the storeroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668288"
msgid "I hear a click-clack from the keys locking the door.\nIt seems that it's been tightly shut from the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668396"
msgid "As I leave the dark storeroom, I think to myself how odd it is.\nHad there always been participants like that here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668512"
msgid "I wonder if I'm still half-asleep……\nI feel more restless this morning than I've ever been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668608"
msgid "It might be a fever, so I should probably\nhead home right after school……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668684"
msgid "Man, what a letdown. I came to check up on you,\nbut it looks like it wasn't necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668772"
msgid "I did say that all I can do is place my bets\non you now that we've come this far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668856"
msgid "If you kick the bucket, I'm in trouble.\nThat's why I came to see how you were doing.\nYep, that's it. No other reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668976"
msgid "By the way…\nYou seem to be holding something.\nWhat is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669036"
msgid "You're awake. I'm glad.\nThere was nothing I could do to help you\nin the state you were in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669128"
msgid "There's no method to ensuring my survival\nsave for you obtaining the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669228"
msgid "I'm talking too much now, aren't I?\nI should brew you some tea my mentor taught me\nto make. It'll cure you of all your fatigue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669356"
msgid "By the way… it appears you've \nbeen holding something since I saw you.\nWhat is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669440"
msgid "Now that she mentions it,\nI've had my fist clenched around something\never since I woke up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669532"
msgid "I wonder what it is?\nI slowly open my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669576"
msgid "This is… a cherry blossom petal?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669612"
msgid "Is this… a cherry blossom petal?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669648"
msgid "I don't know why I was holding onto something like this.\nI must've accidentally grabbed it when I collapsed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669760"
msgid "I turn over my hand to throw it away, but I changed my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669824"
msgid "Cherry blossom petals are rare to find\naround this school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669892"
msgid "For no particular reason,\nI put it away as if it were something important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669968"
msgid "――――Suddenly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669988"
msgid "I got the feeling that someone called out for me to stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670048"
msgid "I seem to hallucinate hearing, \"Senpai.\"\nNaturally I turn around, but see no one there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670136"
msgid "I didn't even realize that tears are streaking down my face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670200"
msgid "I wipe them away with a finger and walk away from the Infirmary.\nI walk down the familiar hallway as I clutch my chest,\nfeeling empty over a light sense of having lost something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670380"
msgid "…this is the remnant of pale pink memories.\n           …the ash left from a film burnt to cinders."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670484"
msgid "――――It was like some final remnant of days gone by,\n        the last fragment of a girl's heart.\n        A girl who had dreamed of love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670628"
msgid "I don't have time to look into where this\nsense of loss is coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670700"
msgid "All I need to focus on right now is winning.\nFocus on the wish-granting #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\nI'm sure I'll understand the meaning of these tears\nonce I obtain it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670872"
msgid "\n My battles continue.\n And ever they will until I reach the Moon Cell's Core,\n waiting at the end of the seven seas――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670996"
msgid "You seem to be in good health.\nI took my eyes off you for one second and\nyou collapsed in a corner of the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671112"
msgid "I was worried you had been poisoned or\nsomething in our battle against that shifty\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF. I'm glad it was nothing serious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671252"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF is her usual self, nothing particularly different.\nI had apparently collapsed,\nbut nothing seems to have happened to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671396"
msgid "I'm overjoyed to see that she hasn't changed.\nI had almost come to a stop,\nbut I push myself to keep moving and follow behind her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671528"
msgid "……so, at last we're in the final act.\nThere are only four Masters left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671604"
msgid "Thinking back on it, we've found ourselves in\npinch after pinch. How my baby bird has grown.\nYou've come so far since the 1st Round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671740"
msgid "Yet you never denied that you were the weakest.\nYou persevered on one step a time. Eventually,\nyou grew strong enough to save my life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671876"
msgid "Our victory against #C236196003Julius#CDEF belongs to you.\nThat devious man's final moments were a\npitiful sight, but he got what he deserved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672020"
msgid "…indeed. You truly have grown strong.\nNo one has the right to call you inept now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672104"
msgid "You're the Master that I revealed\nmy True Name to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672156"
msgid "I shall claim victory for you.\nNo matter what lies before us―― I swear\nto guide you to the seat of Heaven's devoted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672276"
msgid "She holds out her hand, and I grip it back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672320"
msgid "I took down five Masters to get this far in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nSo long as I'm standing on the shoulders of their sacrifice,\nlosing is the one thing I can't do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672500"
msgid "…I take one more look at the flower petal in my hand.\nI don't have time to look into\nwhere this sense of loss is coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672628"
msgid "All I need to focus on right now is winning.\nFocus on the wish-granting #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\nI'm sure I'll understand the meaning of this fragment\nonce I obtain it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672800"
msgid "My battles continue.\n And ever they will until I reach the Moon Cell's Core,\n waiting at the end of the seven seas――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672920"
msgid "…hmm.\nIt feels as though I'm forgetting something…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672976"
msgid "Well, it'll probably come back to me as we\nadvance. Off we go, Praetor. Our opponent for\nthe 6th Round has finally been announced――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673112"
msgid "Awake now? I had stopped sensing you.\nIt was only for a few seconds,\nbut it scared me half to death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673216"
msgid "To think you'd collapse in a corner of the\n2nd floor. Good thing the announcement came in.\nNo going off on your own anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673344"
msgid "How's your injury? Any visible wounds?\nOkay. This must be from the 5th Round…\nA parting gift from #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673468"
msgid "#C236196003Assassin#CDEF was tough.\nThe fatigue must've gotten to you. In any case,\nwhat's most important is that you're okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673596"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF is his usual self, nothing particularly different.\nI had apparently collapsed,\nbut nothing seems to have happened to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673744"
msgid "I'm overjoyed to see that he hasn't changed.\nI had almost come to a stop,\nbut I push myself to keep moving and follow behind him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673876"
msgid "So, shall we get to the daily grind, Master?\nIt's the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's 6th round. From here\non out, battles can't be taken personally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674028"
msgid "Regardless of who we face next,\nyou should prepare while there's still time.\nWe managed to make it this far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674140"
msgid "Sloppy fighting won't fly anymore.\nWe need to take pride in being finalists\nand fight until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674248"
msgid "We made it this far,\nso let's aim for the furthest depths of the Moon.\nIt's there that I'll reclaim my memories\nand my reason for fighting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674388"
msgid "…like an AI girl I saw somewhere did before me.\nI'm going to obtain the meaning behind why this character,\n\"#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\" was awakened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674544"
msgid "I take one more look at the flower petal in my hand.\nI don't have time to look into where this\nsense of loss is coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674672"
msgid "All I need to focus on right now is winning.\nFocus on the wish-granting Holy Grail.\nI'm sure I'll understand the meaning of this fragment\nonce I obtain it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674828"
msgid "There are two rounds left in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nReaching the Moon Cell's Core will itself be\nproof of #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674992"
msgid "There are two rounds left in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nReaching the Moon Cell's Core will itself be\nproof of my existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675128"
msgid "You've grown into your own.\nYou're a fine Master now.\nMuch too good for a blockhead like me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675224"
msgid "Guess I'm the one who needs to prepare himself.\nOh nameless Master without a past or future:\nat the very least, may you seize the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675364"
msgid "Even if the results are decided――\nI'll spend every ounce of strength I've got\nto take you to the seat of Heaven's devoted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675492"
msgid "I'm glad that nothing's wrong with you.\nI got a bad feeling and turned around to find\nyou collapsed. I had no idea what to do…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675620"
msgid "Well, it's all over now, though!\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF and #C236196003Assassin#CDEF were a formidable pair,\nbut no match for Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675756"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF is her usual self, nothing particularly different.\nI had apparently collapsed,\nbut nothing seems to have happened to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675904"
msgid "I'm overjoyed to see that she hasn't changed.\nI had almost come to a stop,\nbut I push myself to keep moving and follow behind her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676036"
msgid "Now, don't relax just because we've won.\nThe remaining four are the real deal――right?\nIt's finally the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's 6th round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676188"
msgid "…you're the person who accepted my True Name,\nfilthy and tainted as I am. Even if I turn to\nash, I'll protect you to my very last breath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676328"
msgid "I'm a #ROFS0003#RUBSshura#RUBEwife#REND who lives to serve her Darling.\nLet's hold hands and take a straight dash\ntowards our happy ending!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676468"
msgid "She holds out her hand, and I grip it back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676512"
msgid "I took down five Masters to get this far in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nSo long as I'm standing on the shoulders of their sacrifice,\nlosing is the one thing I can't do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676692"
msgid "…I take one more look at the flower petal in my hand.\nI don't have time to look into\nwhere this sense of loss is coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676820"
msgid "All I need to focus on right now is winning.\nFocus on the wish-granting #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\nI'm sure I'll understand the meaning of this fragment\nonce I obtain it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676992"
msgid "My battles continue.\nAnd ever they will until I reach the Moon Cell's Core,\nwaiting at the end of the seven seas――"
msgstr ""

